WEBVTT

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.720
Everyone, we wish you all

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.940
a Happy New Year!

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.200
Thanks to all your support, Ojamajo Doremi is entering its second year.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.790
Please continue supporting us.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:27.040
Ojamajo Doremi welcomes the 21st century with new powers that will bring happiness and luck to all of you.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.050
We will continue doing our best this year too!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.020
Thank you very much!

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:15.650
She has a great personality, so I think she's perfect for you.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.110
Well, why don't you meet her?

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.080
Let me think about it.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.640
Dad's Arranged Marriage Meeting.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.480
I'm home!

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.400
Welcome back!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.250
Ya really worked yer butt off durin' New Year's.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:41.260
That's 'cause I drove a whole buncha customers who came a long way to pray.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.470
It was pretty good business.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.890
Wow, what a spread!

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:50.960
I bought it all on sale when the supermarket was about to close.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.570
The prices were slashed again and again, but I'm sure they're still delicious.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.030
Oh, I see.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.520
This is pretty good.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.000
Wait just a sec, I'll go get some sake.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.910
Thanks.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.420
Dad, Happy New Year.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.590
You too.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.400
Work hard this year too.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.090
Cheers!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.340
So good! I'm gettin' all tingly inside!

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:25.300
Here ya go.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:25.330
So good! I'm gettin' all tingly inside!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.010
Thank you.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.110
Wow she's beautiful. Who is she?

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.330
W-What're ya doin'!?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.070
This has nothin' to do with you.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.880
What's wrong with ya?

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.030
Is that a photo fer an arranged marriage meetin'!?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.630
Um...

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.040
Well, you're right.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.000
How can that have nothin' to do with me?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.880
My boss pushed her onto me.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.450
How can ya just calmly drink while sayin' that!?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.590
Don't tell me yer gonna go see her!?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.110
Ya idiot!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.010
I'm thinkin' about how to refuse her!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.760
I see.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.730
It's too early in the year for these kind of surprises.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.220
I'm the one who's surprised!

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:16.720
She may become yer new mother, ya idiot daughter!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.400
I feel sorry for her!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.040
Who's that idiot daughter's father?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.860
It's so late already!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.870
I promised Doremi-chan and Hadzuki-chan that we'd go to the shrine at 11!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.870
I'm fine here, so go on ahead.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.210
Okay.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:46.370
I pray that I can pass the level 1 exam, get a handsome boyfriend, and eat a whole lot of steak.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:52.270
I pray that I can pass the level 1 exam and be able to tell my parents how I feel.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.730
Ai-chan, are you done yet?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.120
Sorry, can ya go on ahead?

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.280
I'm prayin' fer my dad's sake too.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.290
Then we'll be waiting at the fortune telling place.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.110
Okay.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.350
I pray that he doesn't get into a car accident and doesn't break the law.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.040
And I pray that he doesn't want to remarry.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.560
I only want one mom.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.700
Please help me here, dear God.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.810
Thank goodness, I got good luck.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.760
Please, give me great luck.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.470
What? Bad luck?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.180
People say that fortune is the rarest.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:34.180
So I won't fall in love and my wishes won't come true. How is that lucky?

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:36.600
Sorry fer the wait.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.150
Ai-chan, listen to me!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.070
I may become the world's unluckiest pretty girl this year!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.610
What should I do?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:48.820
What're ya talkin' about? Ya should only believe good fortunes.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:51.990
You're right.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.250
Then this is no big deal.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.370
That was quite the fast reversal.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.450
Eh? An arranged marriage meeting?

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.810
D-Don't say it so loudly!

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:05.420
You must be against it.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.060
Of course! Even my dad doesn't want to go.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:11.850
And I prayed to God, so things'll be okay.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:15.170
Was that why you prayed so much?

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.880
Well, yeah kinda.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.270
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, happy New Year.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.520
Pop-chan, happy New Year.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.230
Hey, happy New Year.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.060
Happy New Year.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.900
Why is everyone here?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.240
We met each other on the way.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.020
We're thinking of having lunch together.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:33.910
So we're here to pick you up.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.670
Yes!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.330
Ai-chan, would you like to come too?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:40.790
I'm...

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.790
Don't be shy, come with us.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.590
I ain't bein' shy! My dad is home all alone.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:48.220
I gotta get home.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.550
Thanks fer the invitation, but I can't go.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.130
See ya.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.340
Ai-chan!?

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:59.300
Now then, what should we eat?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.790
Steak!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:02.730
Let's go to Kanae-chan's steakhouse!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.690
We saw it on the way here, but it's closed today.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.820
No way!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:12.320
It's New Year's, so of course restaurants are closed.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.650
Jeez, you're embarrassing us.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.050
Nonsense, you have such a lively daughter.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.920
She's a bit too lively.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.960
Even my dad says that.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.880
Mimi, don't be so sad.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.310
Let's go wish Majo Rika and Lala a happy New Year.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.920
Hey, Majo Ruka, drink some more!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.150
Shenk you...

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:45.010
Anywhatsit, I'm shhoo enbioush of you!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.110
Why?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:52.120
Your apprenticeshses wished you a happy New Year.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:58.700
My Onpu shayss she doeshn't wanna do shquat on New Year'sh!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.080
She doesn't listen to me at all.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.720
That's nothing, compared to these Ojamajos.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.580
Come on, drink up.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:09.350
They fight a lot, but they're actually very good friends.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.510
Ai-chan.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:15.770
You talked about your father's situation, but I think you should follow your own feelings.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:17.090
Oh, really?

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:19.520
I think it's better for your dad to see her.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.290
Why?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:25.100
If you had a new mama, things would be a lot easier for you.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:31.030
And you're being childish, hoarding your dad all for yourself.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.030
That's because she <i>is </i> a child, don't you see?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.910
I really think your dad wants to remarry.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.370
R-Really?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:43.270
Ai-chan, don't listen to her, she's being irresponsible.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.170
Only a grandma like you would think that way.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.880
W-Who are you calling a grandma!?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.000
You're older than me, so of course you're a grandma.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.340
You too! You're not so young, so stop dressing up like a little girl!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.930
Yeah, I lost to a grandma!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.210
What did you say!?

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.390
What? I'm so much better!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.020
Oh no. I think I should go home.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.540
I really think your dad wants to remarry.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.530
What's wrong? Eat up.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:48.880
In just a little bit.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.270
Anyway, do ya want some more?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.740
I'll go fill it up again.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:58.070
Yer bein' way too nice. Kinda creepy.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:09:59.780
Dad?

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.740
Um, why don't ya go to the meetin'?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.300
What're ya talkin' about?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.210
Weren't you against it this morning?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.130
I have a secret I never told you about.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.420
A secret?

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:16.540
Remember when I went to Osaka with Doremi-chan and Hadzuki-chan last fall?

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:17.220
Yeah...

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:22.140
I told ya I didn't meet Mom, but I actually did see her.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.130
R-Really?

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.690
I didn't talk to her though.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.610
Is Mom doin' alright?

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:35.820
Yes, but she remarried and has a baby.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.280
W-W-W-W-What!?

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:42.240
My mom ain't my own anymore!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.110
I-I see...

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.210
Why didn't ya tell me?

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.660
I couldn't...

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.630
It's 'cause yer mom is so pretty.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:00.300
Anyway, Aiko, where's my sake?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.830
Aiko.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:16.190
Ya awake?

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.860
Yes, what is it?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:26.090
If you ain't against it... then I'll go meet her.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:27.650
Sure.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:34.430
Yer mom remarried, so there's no goin' back.

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:36.330
Yeah...

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:37.880
Good night.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:39.730
Good night.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.490
Ah... Ai-chan?

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.270
I'm about to go with Dad to that arranged marriage meeting.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:09.950
Really?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:10.970
Yeah.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:13.390
What's going on? Weren't you against it?

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.520
W-Well, I thought about it.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:22.340
Since Mom's already remarried, it's a bit sad fer Dad to be takin' care of me all by himself.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.680
But how do you feel about it, Ai-chan?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.050
Yeah.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.730
You might end up with a new mother.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.130
I-I'm fine with that.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:38.820
A new mom can help me do chores.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:39.810
Okay, I'll be goin' now.

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:40.940
Ai-chan, wait!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:48.240
I wanted to ask you... Was that baby really your mother's?

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.810
What're ya talkin' about?

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.710
D-Didn't ya see 'em too?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:57.630
I did see them, but I just feel like it may have been a neighbor's baby.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.550
Why didn't you check up on something that important!?

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.130
W-What should I do?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.410
I can't go to Osaka right now...

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.470
Aren't you forgetting about someone?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.580
Yer helpin' me?

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.730
Who the hell do you think I am!?

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:21.640
O Crystal, show me the location of Aiko's mother!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.320
It's Mom!

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.790
Looks like she's in her apartment.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.420
Aiko...

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:35.750
Thanks for the meal.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:38.250
Coming!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:43.960
Okamura-san, sorry to bother you, but can I borrow some MSG?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.410
Sure.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.180
Hello, Takashi-kun.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.430
That's the baby, Ai-chan!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.510
No way!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.130
Oh no, I hafta tell Dad!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:54.970
Ai-chan!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.720
You girls, go follow her.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.480
Are you sure? What about the store?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.440
I'll go call Pop.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.300
Let's go.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:03.850
Okay.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.420
Oh? You're pretty nice when you want to be.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.410
What did ya say!?

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.620
Y-You were mistaken!?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.500
I'm sorry.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.410
Mom hasn't remarried.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:19.880
I don't even...

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.580
Anyway, ya gotta cancel this meeting.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.920
You idiot! How can I do that now!?

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.790
No way...

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:31.110
Senoo-kun. What are you doing in those clothes?

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.180
Hurry up and change.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.560
R-Right!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:35.270
Oh no!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.280
Hadzuki-chan, Doremi-chan, what should I do?

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.940
We have to ruin their meeting!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.970
Y-Yer right.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:46.980
Okay!

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:49.860
I'll mess it all up and make her hate me!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.520
We'll help you with magic.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:54.760
Doremi-chan! Hadzuki-chan!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.830
You really are my best friends!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.880
Thank you.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.290
Okay, here I go.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.090
Ai-chan, fight!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.340
Senoo-kun.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:12.050
You don't have to be so shy, chat a bit with Midori-san.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.510
Um, what are your hobbies?

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.980
I like to travel and listen to music.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:21.800
Midori-san is at a professional level in piano.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.480
Senoo-san, how about you?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.980
Me? Uh...

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.260
I'm...

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.570
Do ya really wanna know, old lady?

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.440
A-Aiko!

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:32.650
It's rude to call her an old lady!

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.410
She's 31 already, so I can't call her a young lady.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:42.580
A-Aiko-chan, Midori-san is asking your father, so...

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.370
Oh, don'tcha worry 'bout it.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.090
My dad sucks at talkin'.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:51.570
So, old lady, his hobbies are bettin' on horse races along with playin' pachinko and mahjong.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:55.440
And he likes to sing in the bath.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:56.510
Don't say that too!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.410
Don't be so shy.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.500
She'll know about these things one day, so just honestly tell her.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:06.940
And when he gets drunk, he starts droolin' and snorin'.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.480
It's like a freight train.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:12.200
Aiko-chan!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:15.660
I love children who are honest.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.850
I'm very straightforward too.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.580
I think we'd get along.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.290
Ah crap, it backfired.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.070
Ai-chan's in trouble.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:25.750
Yeah.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.170
That's it!

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:32.300
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.390
Plate, fall down!

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.510
I'm really sorry!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.070
It's okay, don't worry.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.530
Um, I'm gonna go change, excuse me.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.990
That was probably Doremi-chan's magic.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.970
I'm the best at that kind of magic.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.000
He's back.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:04.830
You're so handsome.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:10.420
I've always loved men in work uniforms.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.550
Doremi-chan!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.700
I think I screwed up.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.220
Let me try this time.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:22.180
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.780
Come out, the coldest joke!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.450
Anyway, the weather's so nice today.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.360
So nice, it'll last until tonight.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.190
So cold.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.170
Hadzuki-chan, nice.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:39.260
W-What happened?

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.810
How could I tell such a cold joke?

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:42.790
Who am I, Shimada Shinsuke?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.870
So cold!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.900
Midori-chan, please contain yourself.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:55.130
But if we were to marry, I'm sure we'd be very happy together.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.240
Oh dear.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.300
Her brain's the same as Hadzuki-chan's.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.810
You think it's funny!?

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:05.610
They may not find it easy to talk to each other with us here. Right?

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:06.840
Ahh yes.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:09.230
Senoo-kun, why don't you take a walk with her?

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.690
Senoo-san, let's go.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.740
Aiko-chan, you can stay here.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.240
The mood's too perfect.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.760
Oh no...

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.950
I'm just goin' to the bathroom.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.670
What're you two doin'!?

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.790
We're sorry.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.250
Whatever, I'll do it myself.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:35.380
I heard from your boss that you divorced because of your wife's job.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.210
Well, yeah...

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:40.490
If we married, I think I would quit my job and help you.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.420
Oh no!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:45.060
The mood is too perfect!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:45.970
Gonna ruin it!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:51.770
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.320
Have all the fish in the pond jump out!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.200
I-I'm sorry.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.050
Oh no, not again...

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:07.940
What are you girls doing way out here?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.620
Onpu-chan!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.100
Onpu-chan, what are you doing here?

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.350
I was doing an interview and a gravure photo shoot.

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.870
We just finished.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.590
Anyway, it's not good, casting magic here.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.410
There's no other way.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.800
Actually...

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.830
I see.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.490
Stop laughing, it's rude!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.450
Think about Ai-chan's feelings!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:33.790
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.430
But you're using the wrong magic.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:40.320
You just need to cast magic on the woman to make her hate your father.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.920
You can't do that!

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.410
It's forbidden to alter people's thoughts!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.370
Then I'll do it for you.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.580
You can't! There will be consequences!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.150
Ai-chan, you're following the rules too much.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:55.710
I think you should be more honest with yourself.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:02.310
I'll do it.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.340
Ai-chan!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.350
Don't worry, I ain't gonna use magic.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.310
Aiko-chan is such a bright child.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.520
If you can, may I...

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.770
Oh no!

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.240
I think Midori-san is cool, but I can't agree to this.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.950
Aiko...

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:31.460
I only want one mom!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:37.260
I wasn't honest with myself... I'm sorry.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:40.530
Dad, I...

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:44.060
I don't want a new mom!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.810
Aiko!

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:56.480
I understand, Aiko-chan.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:01.240
Senoo-san, our side will refuse the marriage proposal.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.290
Midori-san...

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.990
If the man refuses, he'll lose too much face.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:07.730
Take care.

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.450
Midori-san.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.910
Thank you.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:18.400
Aiko-chan, even if I couldn't marry your father, I really wanted you as my daughter.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:23.110
I'm really sorry!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:29.160
I'm really sorry!

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.660
He looks super angry!

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:32.640
Oh well.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:36.600
Either way, Midori-san was fabulous.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.000
Yeah, she was the perfect match for you.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.710
But Midori-san should find someone better.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.090
W-What did you say!?

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.100
Hey!

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:48.570
Stop lookin' down on yer father!

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.780
It all worked out, Ai-chan.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.950
Hey, get back here!

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:56.170
Hey, Aiko!

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.240
Hey!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.120
Onpu-chan's...

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.990
Love confession e-mail!

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:07.550
Who's the lucky one that received the e-mail?

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:08.670
It's Nakata-kun!

00:22:08.670 --> 00:22:10.340
And it's a date in the park!

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:12.250
So lovey-dovey!

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:15.820
But Nakata-kun has never spoken to Onpu-chan before.

00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:18.040
Why is she suddenly confessin' to him?

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:19.940
I'm sure it's love at first sight.

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:22.610
No way!

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:23.980
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:25.760
Onpu's E-Mail was a Love Letter?

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:28.750
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
